# Monorepo-wide ignores

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# Build caches and incremental metadata
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.cache/
**/.tmp/
**/.temp/

# Test/framework local state
**/.hypothesis/

# Runtime database sidecars
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Local test outputs
**/test_output*.txt

# OS/editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
